# Vauxhall Astra Mk4 five-door hatchback, 1998-2004.
#
# The fourth Astra: 4,110 mm long, 1,709 mm wide, 1,425 mm high, 2,606 mm
# wheelbase; 1.4-2.0 petrol and diesels.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opel_Astra#Astra_G_(1998%E2%80%932004)
#
# Colours: Star Silver, Black Sapphire, Rioja Red and Breeze Blue are period
# Vauxhall colours.
#
# Weight: 300 in total (silver 95, black 75, red 65, blue 65).
#
# Speed 180 km/h; comfort 110/345 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 1998-2004 with a road tail to about 2013.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vauxhall-astra-mk4.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vauxhall-astra-mk4/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia
# Commons.

